//
// Block and transaction vectors. Generated with the reference
// implementation (dashpay/dash v24.0.0, 938fba5028).
//
// Each section comes with the program used to generate the vectors.
//
// To run a program, move its `#include` lines to the top of
// `src/test/blockencodings_tests.cpp` at the specified revision and paste the
// rest at the end of the `blockencodings_tests` suite. Build it with
// `make -C src test/test_dash` and run
// `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=blockencodings_tests/<name>` with
// `--log_level=nothing --report_level=no`. The output should match the
